<description>&lt;p&gt;U.S. soldiers are now operating alongside Ecuadorian forces against cartels, and MQ-9 Reaper drones have been moved from Africa to support operations in Colombia and Ecuador. A fishing vessel off Ecuador's coast was attacked, killing multiple people and extending the violence to the maritime domain. Workers at a mining company linked to a wealthy Australian individual report threats and intimidation from unknown actors, while pressure on Los Choneros is shifting from leadership to their logistics networks. The conflict has resulted in 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNeEFWMGlqekJFZ3lFYm5GeEhnRzdWQ2ZVa2tPS1lob3ZKaXlMS1FMMjRZUmx0aDBNbkdIR1pvTktJZTAwQ0FBdU85VWd6aXRqb0k0ZHZ3UnlubGNJT1lVY1lleU1RNk1FWHJGSlhrcnZFbVhkSXFNdDlmR1RQcHVsbEo3VG9VVVFHTXIwUGhpRGdhTkRxS2FCY192TWhnRy1vNVRMd0h3?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxPajZUbGM0RmUtdjZzdzRFSmhBQ3dsc3k2bXlwYndqd2FJc2JDZjhBMFE5di1FUFR1NTRRLTZiZzZsM0tsN1BJQ3JzV01LbFdDbWduMnNENDB5QmZkODRzbWVxTWF3cF9ucU5vZmpjbjJULWltMWpIVWxBTzFWRWlxeQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQYVl3UFlsZG9yR1lZOGRuVzJtXzczNlZHalNfQlZjNTBEcGh4Z3NHNmpWOVRpSTJ5ejFSdVAzbXFQNU1iRkZnSzBoZEJFbm1wem8yZUVnQ05tVVpHWUpfOWU2dzVsR3N4NWJDLXllNTdydHlWaVVYcGhQeHMyQ3M2YUpkQUxseW05Tm1ub1BxcE9oanZJTmtaeUFmNm5Cd1dzUy1lWFpfZ3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ratopati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Homeland Security Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Freshfields&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE5CZ0RrUVNMNHN1RXViSjB1b3RIUGtvWDAybTBTUDB3ZWFIV2xBajR6N3lhQWNIR1F2RmIxWnpfZ2hqRGg3VEJWcy13RGI2VGZzTXlvZkYxUQ?oc=5&